Le principali funzionalità sono:
 
* Manages wine-specific item data, including alcohol content, year, bottle volume, and other wine-related characteristics.
* All Business Central documents have been extended to include quantities expressed in both liters and kilograms, ensuring accurate management and traceability of wine products.
* Enables the management of wine treatments, ensuring fast, controlled, and fully traceable execution of winery operations.   
* Enables the management of bottling orders and official DOCG control seals, including allocation, tracking, and reconciliation with bottling activities.
* Assignment Management (reservation of expensive wine bottles).
* Lot Number Format Management.

